  <p id="c-songshu-052-song060-chudanzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-052-song060-chudanzhi:p001:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAA">秀之</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-052-song060-chudanzhi:p001:m0003" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAE">淡之</persName>，字<persName id="c-songshu-052-song060-chudanzhi:p001:m0007" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAE">仲源</persName>，亦歷顯官，為高祖車騎從事中郎，尚書吏部郎，廷尉卿，左衞將軍。高祖受命，為侍中。</p>
